<title>THAILAND: Thai central bank intervenes, supports baht - trade.</title>
<headline>Thai central bank intervenes, supports baht - trade.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's central bank intervened in the local baht market on Wednesday to arrest the currency's slide to new record lows, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;We noticed the central bank intervened to stop the baht's fall at around the 32.50/32.60 to the dollar level,&quot; a senior dealer with a local bank told Reuters.</p>
</text>
